{"title":"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Three thousandths is equal to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/6/2166b990f56be1c8c9d1b12f656d9dadf149db7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 300 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 0.3 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 0.03 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 30 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 0.003$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"448\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Converting the number from words to a number, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/9/399ee8ef8af4b3f180a0de204f35d4284c2227f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(E) } 0.003}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"88\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not ex